  "baseline": "792ffb35a9c1c127c90c3ba0e8ad084a2d8dea63",
  "scope": "A sparse cold alias-descendant topology and the existing unchanged-full-View proof. Preserve the complete alias permission set. No Source, Queue, capture, ownership or retirement protocol change.",
