  "implementation": [
    "Index every descendant of an external input primary physical root, including non-View/in-place entries that must reject the shortcut. Cold bounded parent walk supports arbitrary legal physical numbering.",
    "Replace the old all-instances times all-steps proof with a lower_bound and only this root’s indexed descendants. Each still checks the current physical description and bound offset, required full bytes and the old prepared View complete resource/handle/offset/span.",
    "Physical input binding can reuse only an existing candidate whose entire readonly View closure passes that proof. A nonmaterializing View has no submission_inputs entry; skip that empty slot only after the complete View proof. All actual command/ready-only/native/replica checks remain.",
    "Keep external_input_aliases and projected bank/read qualification unchanged. resources.cc is not edited; noncaller configuration/projected alias reset retains its original conservative fallback."
  ],
